<title>GREECE: BANK OF CYPRUS OPENS SECOND BRANCH IN HERAKLION.</title>
<headline>BANK OF CYPRUS OPENS SECOND BRANCH IN HERAKLION.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Curpys said its second branch in Heraklion, Crete opened for business on Tuesday offering the full spectrum of its banking services and products.</p>
<p>Including the new branch, the Bank of Cyprus' branch network in Greece numbers 10 with one more branch soon expected to start operations in Chania, Crete. --Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
